<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Page not found — Evo Meals' }) %>
</head>
<body>
<div class="notfound-shell">
  <div class="notfound-card" data-reveal>
    <a href="/" class="notfound-logo"><span>Evo <span class="dot">Meals</span></span></a>
    <div class="notfound-mark" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 8.5a8 8 0 0 1 12 0M8.5 11a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7 0M12 14v.01"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h1>This reader didn't recognize that page.</h1>
    <p>The link might be old, or the address might be off by a character. Either way, nothing tapped — let's get you back to somewhere real.</p>
    <div class="notfound-actions">
      <% if (typeof parentId !== 'undefined' && parentId) { %>
        <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">Back to your dashboard</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">Back to the homepage</a>
      <% } %>
      <a href="/login" class="btn btn-ghost">Log in</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
